### NMate internal API — manual testing (VS Code REST Client / Rider / Visual Studio)
# Token: dotnet user-secrets --project src/SUPPORT.Api list   → InternalClients:0:Token
@host = http://localhost:5160
@token = paste-InternalClients:0:Token-here
@user = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@org = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222

### Health (no token)
GET {{host}}/health/ready

### Status — never calls Gemini
GET {{host}}/internal/v1/status
X-Internal-Token: {{token}}

### Re-index DASHBOARD/Knowledge (costs embedding quota only for changed files)
POST {{host}}/internal/v1/knowledge/reindex
X-Internal-Token: {{token}}

### Suggestions for a screen
GET {{host}}/internal/v1/suggestions?route=/acme/DASH/sprint-planning
X-Internal-Token: {{token}}

### Ask (server-sent events)
POST {{host}}/internal/v1/chat
X-Internal-Token: {{token}}
X-User-Id: {{user}}
X-Org-Id: {{org}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Vì sao tôi không tạo được sprint?",
  "context": { "route": "/acme/DASH/sprint-planning" }
}

### My conversations
GET {{host}}/internal/v1/conversations
X-Internal-Token: {{token}}
X-User-Id: {{user}}
X-Org-Id: {{org}}
